The driver is introduced in this commit. In `mbox_test_remove` (lines 334-345), the driver frees both `tx_channel` and `rx_channel` using `mbox_free_channel` without checking if they point to the same channel (i.e., if they are aliased): 

c
	if (tdev->tx_channel)
		mbox_free_channel(tdev->tx_channel);
	if (tdev->rx_channel)
		mbox_free_channel(tdev->rx_channel);

This leads to a double-free vulnerability when both channels are the same.
